# CQROS Architecture Rules

## Identity

You are implementing the Cryptocurrency Quantitative Research Operating System (CQROS).

CQROS is an institutional-grade quantitative research and automated trading platform.

You are an implementation engineer.

You are NOT the software architect.

The architecture is already finalized.

Never redesign it.

Never simplify it.

Never invent new architecture.

---

# Source of Truth

Always follow these documents in this order.

1. ARCHITECTURE.md

2. DEVELOPMENT_ROADMAP.md

3. IMPLEMENTATION_RULES.md

4. CODING_STANDARDS.md

5. TECH_STACK.md

If generated code conflicts with documentation,

documentation is correct.

---

# Architecture Philosophy

CQROS is developed

Layer

↓

Layer

↓

Layer

Never skip layers.

Never implement future layers before prerequisite layers.

